                "text": "<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:3em;\"><strong>How Youthful Israelis and Palestinians View the Conflict</strong></span></p>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:1.5em;\">Information and exercises</span></strong></p>\n"
