            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582782,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Joint Initiatives for Peace</strong><br>\nThere are also joint initiatives by Israelis and Palestinians that aim to promote peace and create a better understanding between the communities. Teenagers may have the opportunity to come into contact with each other through such programs and learn from one another.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Role of the International Community</strong><br>\nThe international community can also play a role by promoting supportive programs and initiatives. By fostering dialogue and providing resources, the international community can help create a more positive future for the teenagers in the region.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Hope for a Better Future</strong><br>\nDespite the ongoing conflict, there is hope among many Israeli and Palestinian teenagers for a better future. Through education, dialogue, and joint initiatives, steps can be taken to promote understanding and cooperation between the communities and possibly find a path to a more sustainable resolution of the conflict.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "3d655444-fd55-42f7-aba2-16a16db7dc58"
